    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 An Evil Spirit born from Goddess Shilen's despair, woe, and rage. Although he fought in the war with the gods on the side of Shilen during the Era of Myths, he was greatly injured in the battle, and has been hiding under the protection of the Water Dragon Fafuion. Lately, he has been rumored to propagate Shilen's return. He serves Fafurion, waiting for the day when Shilen and Evil Spirits dominate the world again. Beast Lv. 3 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Beasts. Critical Damage +7.5% Atk. Spd. +5% Speed +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sword +10% Resistance to Dual Sword +10% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resistance to Dagger -10% Resistance to Dual Dagger -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
